      "title": "Conditional Optimal Bridge for Riemannian Activation Steering",
      "title_zh": "黎曼激活引导的条件最优桥方法",
      "authors": [
        "Seyed Arshan Dalili",
        "Ajay Narayanan Sridhar",
        "Vijaykrishnan Narayanan",
        "Mehrdad Mahdavi"
      ],
