      "title": "LLM Detection as an Intervention: Downstream Impact under Strategic User Behavior",
      "title_zh": "作为干预手段的大语言模型检测：策略用户行为下的下游影响",
      "authors": [
        "Meena Jagadeesan",
        "Tatsunori Hashimoto",
        "Jon Kleinberg"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.19300v1",
