      "week": "2026-W30",
      "title": "V-DEAL: Diagnosing Video Safety De-Calibration as an Understanding-Refusal Coupling Failure",
      "title_zh": "V-DEAL：将视频安全去校准诊断为理解-拒绝耦合失败",
      "authors": [
        "Zhetong Zhang",
        "Honghao Fu",
        "Miao Xu",
        "Yiwei Wang",
        "Yujun Cai"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21151v1",
