      "title": "LLM4CKD: Large Language Models for Early Stage Chronic Kidney Disease Screening",
      "title_zh": "LLM4CKD：用于慢性肾病早期筛查的大语言模型",
      "authors": [
        "Muhammad Ashad Kabir",
        "Sirajam Munira"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.04013v1",
