      "evaluation_environment": "GUI-RobustEval、OSWorld，评测指标为成功率、All-Pass@4",
      "evaluation_signal": "RoTS-32B在OSWorld达到47.4%成功率、33.8%All-Pass@4的SOTA性能，验证了错误恢复能力的价值。",
