      "title": "From Siloed Algorithms to Compliance-First Agentic Platforms: A Multi-Layered Architecture for Hospital AI Systems",
      "title_zh": "从孤岛算法到合规优先智能体平台：面向医院AI系统的多层架构",
      "authors": [
        "Manideep Dhar",
        "Ritwik Singh",
        "Sharat Chandra Kumar Manikonda"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06112v1",
