      "title": "OEIS Open: How many conjectures can language models turn into theorems?",
      "title_zh": "OEIS Open：大语言模型能将多少个猜想转化为定理？",
      "authors": [
        "Tom Adamczewski"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11941v1",
