      "evaluation_environment": "SWE-bench Verified、OpenHands SDK、Claude Code、OpenCode",
      "evaluation_signal": "LEGO-RL在三个原生代码harness上均提升Qwen模型的SWE-bench Verified准确率，同时保持训练概率相关性高于0.99。",
