      "id": "2608.21027",
      "direction_id": "agent-skills-harness",
      "direction_name": "Agent Skills 与 Harness",
      "week": "2026-W35",
      "title": "Don't Solve, Just Compare: Tiny Advisors for Runtime Intervention in LLM Agents",
      "title_zh": "不必求解，只需比较：面向大语言模型智能体运行时干预的微型顾问",
      "authors": [
        "Yanze Jiang",
        "Mingxuan Li",
        "Yuhao Wang",
        "Shengfang Zhai",
        "Jiaheng Zhang"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21027v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.21027v1",
      "category": "cs.AI",
      "published": "2026-08-21 12:20:14+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-08-24",
      "abstract": "LLM agents are emerging as an important paradigm for real-world tasks that require reasoning, tool use, and sequential decision-making. As these agents operate over longer horizons, runtime intervention offers a way to improve reliability without retraining the underlying actor. Failure detection alone is insufficient. Effective intervention must also provide a useful direction for recovery. Existing approaches often rely on an expert solver or a critic that generates task-specific corrections, incurring either the cost of another capable solver or the capacity demands of a task-capable critic. We introduce Comparison-Only Tiny Advisor (COTA), a comparison-only framework for constructive runtime intervention. In COTA, a tiny comparator judges whether sampled alternatives lead to better continuations than the actor's proposal, and repeated comparisons determine when intervention is warranted. We train the comparator using pairwise supervision constructed from same-prefix counterfactual branches. Preferred alternatives are returned as non-binding advice, leaving the original actor to replan. Across WebShop, ALFWorld, and tau^3-Retail with three actors, COTA improves all nine evaluation settings and outperforms the compared baselines. These results show that constructive runtime intervention can remain effective even when the auxiliary model has substantially weaker task-solving capability than the actor.",
      "abstract_zh": "大语言模型智能体是面向需要推理、工具使用与序贯决策的真实任务的重要范式。长轨迹运行时干预可无需重训练基础智能体提升可靠性，现有方法依赖专家求解器或任务特定评论器，成本与资源开销高。本文提出仅比较框架COTA，用微型比较器判断候选是否优于原方案，给出非绑定建议供原智能体重规划，在三个环境九个设置上均优于基线，证明弱辅助模型仍可实现有效干预。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "现有大语言模型智能体运行时干预依赖强能力辅助模型，成本开销大，仅失败检测无法提供有效恢复方向。",
      "method": "提出仅比较的运行时干预框架COTA，用成对监督训练微型比较器，通过多次比较决策是否干预，给出非绑定建议。",
      "contribution": "提出COTA干预框架，在多个基准的九个评测设置均提升性能，证明弱能力辅助模型仍可实现有效干预。",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "辅助模型任务求解能力远弱于原智能体时，仅比较的运行时干预仍可生效，九个评测设置全部实现性能提升。",
      "theme": "智能体运行时干预",
      "method_family": "agent harness",
      "agent_setting": "tool-use",
      "control_mechanism": "基于成对监督训练微型比较器，通过多次比较判断是否需要干预，输出非绑定建议引导原智能体重规划改进行为。",
      "evaluation_environment": "WebShop、ALFWorld、tau^3-Retail",
      "evaluation_signal": "搭配三个不同原智能体，在三个基准的共九个评测设置中全部实现性能提升，效果优于所有对比基线。",
      "failure_mode": "长轨迹运行时可靠性不足，现有干预依赖强能力模型，仅失败检测无法提供有效恢复方向。",
      "reliability_risk": "监督数据依赖同前缀反事实分支构造，未验证严重错误场景下的干预有效性。",
      "industrial_relevance": "high",
      "read_priority": "high",
      "baselines": [
        "基于专家求解器的干预方法",
        "基于任务能力评论器的干预方法"
      ],
      "datasets": [
        "WebShop",
        "ALFWorld",
        "tau^3-Retail"
      ]
