      "title": "FLARE: Verifying MILP Reformulations with LLM-Based Theorem Proving",
      "title_zh": "FLARE：基于大语言模型定理证明的混合整数线性规划重构验证",
      "authors": [
        "Henry Robbins",
        "Connor Lawless",
        "Madeleine Udell",
        "Ellen Vitercik"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25220v1",
