      "id": "2608.30916",
      "direction_id": "agent-skills-harness",
      "direction_name": "Agent Skills 与 Harness",
      "week": "2026-W36",
      "title": "Selection-Aware Stress Testing for Interactive Agents",
      "title_zh": "面向交互智能体的选择感知压力测试",
      "authors": [
        "Yang Xu",
        "Chenang Li",
        "Jiefu Zhang",
        "Haixiang Sun",
        "Zhou Li",
        "Vaneet Aggarwal"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.30916v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.30916v1",
      "category": "cs.LG",
      "published": "2026-08-31 14:58:04+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-09-01",
      "abstract": "Agent evaluations often use one benchmark to choose a workflow and then search for task types where its advantage weakens, so both conclusions are selected from the same data. We introduce Selection-Aware Semantic Stress Testing (\\SASST{}), which learns a task reweighting from pre-execution features on discovery tasks and evaluates the same paired comparison on separate confirmation tasks. The protocol checks support and stability, uses joint bounds for all planned claims, and can return no claim. We prove conditional asymptotic validity under stated cluster assumptions. A forty-cluster audit finds Gaussian undercoverage and conservative Bonferroni $t$ bounds. In one 480-episode $τ$-bench study, a $3.75$ point discovery gain vanished on confirmation. A second-model study likewise confirmed neither a workflow benefit nor a stable stress rule.",
      "abstract_zh": "现有智能体评测通常使用同一个基准选择工作流，再搜索其优势减弱的任务类型，两次结论都从同一数据选出，存在偏差。本文提出选择感知语义压力测试SASST，从发现任务的预执行特征学习任务重加权，在独立验证任务上开展配对比较评估，可检验结论的支撑性与稳定性，在给定聚类假设下证明了其条件渐近有效性，实验发现原有收益在验证中消失。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "现有交互智能体评测中，工作流选择与结论验证都基于同一数据集，容易得出虚假的错误结论",
      "method": "提出选择感知语义压力测试SASST，在发现任务学习任务重加权，在独立验证任务完成评估检验",
      "contribution": "提出新的智能体压力评测协议，理论证明其条件渐近有效性，实验揭示了现有评测的偏差问题",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "在480回合的τ-bench研究中，发现阶段取得的3.75点增益在验证阶段完全消失，未确认任何工作流收益",
      "theme": "智能体压力评测",
      "method_family": "evaluation/benchmark",
      "agent_setting": "交互智能体",
      "control_mechanism": "通过分离发现任务与验证任务的评测框架，约束评测选择偏差，提升智能体评测结论的可靠性",
      "evaluation_environment": "τ-bench",
      "evaluation_signal": "检验评测结论的支撑性与稳定性，发现基于同一数据得到的性能增益在独立验证中无法复现",
      "failure_mode": "同一数据同时用于模型选择和结论验证，导致评测得出假阳性错误结论",
      "reliability_risk": "错误的评测结论会误导智能体工作流选型，给工业落地带来决策风险与不必要成本",
      "industrial_relevance": "high",
