      "title": "QueenBee Planner: Skill-Evolving Communication Topologies for Token-Efficient LLM Multi-Agent Systems",
      "title_zh": "蜂后规划器：面向令牌高效大语言模型多智能体系统的技能进化通信拓扑",
      "authors": [
        "Congjia Tian",
        "Yuhang Yao",
        "Jiaming Cui"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.27492v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.27492v1",
