      "title": "Securing Agentic AI: From Per-Action Checks to Trajectory Assurance",
      "title_zh": "保障智能体AI安全：从单动作检查到轨迹保证",
      "authors": [
        "Alireza Lotfi",
        "Subangkar Karmaker Shanto",
        "Imtiaz Karim",
        "Elisa Bertino"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.01558v1",
