      "title": "Provable Benefits of RLVR over SFT for Reasoning Models: Learning to Backtrack Efficiently",
      "title_zh": "推理模型中RLVR相对SFT的可证明优势：高效回溯学习",
      "authors": [
        "Stanley Wei",
        "Juno Kim"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.22938v1",
