      "title": "AI Training Manager: Bounded Closed-Loop Control of Adaptive Training Recipes",
      "title_zh": "《AI训练管理器：自适应训练方案的有界闭环控制》",
      "authors": [
        "Anjali Rao",
        "Nikhil Kamalkumar Advani"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29871v1",
