      "title": "DistilledGemma: Balanced Efficiency-Accuracy for Person-Place Relation Extraction from Multilingual Historical Articles",
      "title_zh": "DistilledGemma：面向多语言历史文章人地关系抽取的平衡效率与精度模型",
      "authors": [
        "Youssef Aboelwafa",
        "Ahmed Samir",
        "Nagwa Elmakky",
        "Marwan Torki"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29130v1",
