      "title": "Hi-TTRL: Regulating Consensus with Hints for Test-Time Reinforcement Learning",
      "title_zh": "Hi-TTRL：面向测试时强化学习的提示引导共识调节方法",
      "authors": [
        "Kunbin Xu",
        "Xingzuo Li",
        "Xuefeng Bai",
        "Kehai Chen"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.03545v2",
