      "title": "Proof-Carrying Cognition: Closing the Verification Gap with Reality-Settled Reward",
      "title_zh": "《带证明认知：借助现实锚定奖励弥合验证差距》",
      "authors": [
        "Eshwar Reddy M",
        "Sourav Karmakar"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.09776v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.09776v1",
